    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_521007ac1a8edc60294f",
      "document_start": 59,
      "document_end": 81,
      "text": "# 第5章 火炮与自动武器动力学有限元方法;",
      "section_id": "section_689c24a9abcf"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_eb66bfcde0ead5e33301",
      "document_start": 82,
      "document_end": 114,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_689c24a9abcf"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_d5cf0cc60c0843c4b95f",
      "document_start": 116,
      "document_end": 146,
      "text": "有限元方法的出现，是数值分析方法研究领域内的重大突破性进展。",
      "section_id": "section_689c24a9abcf"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_7a93966265dbda340c17",
      "document_start": 146,
      "document_end": 199,
      "text": "有限元方法对模型进行近似计算，将连续体简化为由有限个单元组成的离散化模型，并对离散后的模型求解出数值答案。",
      "section_id": "section_689c24a9abcf"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_e0f7fb79eff424966dd3",
      "document_start": 199,
      "document_end": 221,
      "text": "与其他求解方法相比，有限元方法具有如下优点。",
      "section_id": "section_689c24a9abcf"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_360c917bd76ac54c5437",
      "document_start": 221,
      "document_end": 231,
      "text": "第一，物理概念清晰。",
      "section_id": "section_689c24a9abcf"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_d909d08b2fbadb2dc7d3",
      "document_start": 231,
      "document_end": 268,
      "text": "对于力学问题，有限元方法一开始就从力学角度进行简化，使用者易于掌握和使用。",
      "section_id": "section_689c24a9abcf"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_80c4ad1816c6ccc8f3d1",
      "document_start": 268,
      "document_end": 279,
      "text": "第二，灵活性和通用性。",
      "section_id": "section_689c24a9abcf"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_e5b18770dcc3f0e760d2",
      "document_start": 279,
      "document_end": 325,
      "text": "有限元方法不但可以解决具有规则几何特性和均匀材料特性的问题，还可以解决不规则边界非线性问题。",
      "section_id": "section_689c24a9abcf"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_ad5a08ce6367c938a11e",
      "document_start": 325,
      "document_end": 403,
      "text": "但有限元方法对于各种复杂因素（例如复杂几何形状，任意边界条件，不均匀材料特性，结构包含杆、板、壳等不同类型构件等）要灵活地加以考虑，以避免产生处理上的难题。",
      "section_id": "section_689c24a9abcf"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_062461550b1013772567",
      "document_start": 405,
      "document_end": 425,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 2;",
      "section_id": "section_689c24a9abcf"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_b74b194e68e8550a62c5",
      "document_start": 426,
      "document_end": 444,
      "text": "# 5.1.1 分析对象及简化模型;",
      "section_id": "section_689c24a9abcf"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_e1c8f523ba9c50b4fc45",
      "document_start": 445,
      "document_end": 477,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_689c24a9abcf"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_87d69b90e60153dfffc2",
      "document_start": 479,
      "document_end": 525,
      "text": "一般需要用有限元方法来求解的问题，结构都比较复杂，而有限元方法的明显优势就在于求解复杂结构。",
      "section_id": "section_689c24a9abcf"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_bc3a22458058e3156bd8",
      "document_start": 525,
      "document_end": 642,
      "text": "对于一个复杂结构，肯定会存在许多特征，由于计算机条件限制，不可能把模型做得十分庞大，另外，也由于网格划分算法的局限，对于一些小特征的存在（比如小圆孔、小倒角等），不但会影响网格质量，有时甚至会导致无法生成网格，即使求得结果，也不可靠。",
      "section_id": "section_689c24a9abcf"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_003332d9440d01705b9c",
      "document_start": 642,
      "document_end": 682,
      "text": "相反，忽略这些小特征，却对结果影响不大，有利于生成高质量网格，从而得到理想结果。",
      "section_id": "section_689c24a9abcf"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_c293c4e7f5b89dfd363c",
      "document_start": 682,
      "document_end": 712,
      "text": "因此，分析对象及简化模型这一步至关重要，直接影响结果可靠性。",
      "section_id": "section_689c24a9abcf"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_3b6b81330cbb8caf8caa",
      "document_start": 712,
      "document_end": 737,
      "text": "但究竟怎样去抓住问题的主要矛盾，而忽略次要矛盾呢？",
      "section_id": "section_689c24a9abcf"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_cb8c49ce4bef3eb543d4",
      "document_start": 737,
      "document_end": 792,
      "text": "这就需要使用者有一定的力学基础，熟悉所分析结构和相关专业知识，熟练掌握有限元软件，并具有丰富的有限元分析经验。",
      "section_id": "section_689c24a9abcf"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_7a17574b4d4d2a4f5136",
      "document_start": 794,
      "document_end": 814,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 3;",
      "section_id": "section_689c24a9abcf"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_564b01be26b66781eeee",
      "document_start": 815,
      "document_end": 833,
      "text": "# 5.1.2 建立有限元分析模型;",
      "section_id": "section_689c24a9abcf"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_e754d16cc3cba5f33c92",
      "document_start": 834,
      "document_end": 866,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_689c24a9abcf"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_a48abe1c5a6f1b9b5043",
      "document_start": 868,
      "document_end": 916,
      "text": "模型网格图绘制的目的有两个：一是在有限元分析之前检查所有输入或生成的有关模型的几何数据是否正确；",
      "section_id": "section_689c24a9abcf"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_bcdad68533b7dd07cf58",
      "document_start": 916,
      "document_end": 929,
      "text": "二是直接观察模型剖分结果。",
      "section_id": "section_689c24a9abcf"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_fe99d4adb02e8aca873d",
      "document_start": 929,
      "document_end": 953,
      "text": "这两点对有限元计算结果的正确性和可靠性至关重要。",
      "section_id": "section_689c24a9abcf"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_85799e4ceebf0bd4f804",
      "document_start": 955,
      "document_end": 975,
